hairiokuilo-by-luminaire (1.0-0ddebs4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patch-binary.pl, debian/shader.frag : patch the executable at
    build time, the picture stayed white. The intro reused stack slots as
    arguments of glLinkProgram() and glUseProgram(), NVIDIA drivers
    overwrite them. The shader gets a #version for Mesa, and an explicit
    smoothstep() for reversed edges
  * debian/rules : run debian/patch-binary.pl, install the patched copy
  * debian/control : added alsa-utils, aplay plays the music; described
    the intro
  * debian/copyright : removed the Upstream-Contact placeholder, Source
    points to scene.org
  * debian/resources : added a real icon (the PNG was empty), desktop
    file with Keywords and French comment
  * debian/scripts : described as a 4k intro, aplay in quiet mode
  * debian/hairiokuilo-by-luminaire.lintian-overrides : override
    statically-linked-binary (hand-made ELF without section headers) and
    groff-message from the pandoc preamble
  * debian/README.source : explained the unpacked binary, and why
    dh_makeshlibs is skipped (objdump cannot read the executable)
  * debian/docs : removed the empty file
  * manpage : documented audio output, the windowed mode and the binary
    patches

 -- Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:10:21 +0100

